<title>USA: Securities suit against Scios dismissed.</title>
<headline>Securities suit against Scios dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scios Inc said a judge in the U.S. District Court in California dismissed securities litigation against it and its chief executive, Richard Casey.</p>
<p>It said the dismissal was made with prejudice, meaning  the plaintiffs will not have the opportunity to refile their complaint.</p>
<p>Scios was not immediately available to name the plaintiffs or discuss the specific charges, but said in a statement the suit had alleged Scios violated federal securities laws with statments about clinical studies of its Auriculin drug candidate.</p>
</text>
